312
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:44,040
Kanagawa School of Medical Science
Secondary Hospital

313
00:17:43,330 --> 00:17:44,040
Excuse me.

314
00:17:44,670 --> 00:17:47,170
Is Nurse Yabuuchi from
the Internal Medicine department available?

315
00:17:47,170 --> 00:17:49,210
I'm her younger sister.

316
00:17:49,210 --> 00:17:52,330
Uh, let's see. Does anyone know
where Ms. Yabuuchi is right now?

317
00:17:52,330 --> 00:17:55,460
In room 305, doing her check 
up on Mrs. Kurumatani.

318
00:17:55,670 --> 00:17:59,040
Oh, then I'll just head directly over
to that room, if that's okay.

319
00:17:59,250 --> 00:18:01,330
These flowers I brought are 
actually for that patient.

320
00:18:01,540 --> 00:18:02,670
Oh, how nice.

321
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:04,830
Yuka Kurumatani

322
00:18:05,580 --> 00:18:06,960
Good afternoon.

323
00:18:09,080 --> 00:18:09,790
Oh my.

324
00:18:10,710 --> 00:18:11,830
Madoka?!

325
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:14,750
Um, I'm... s-s-sorry....!

326
00:18:15,170 --> 00:18:17,460
You should at least knock 
before you come in, jeez!

327
00:18:17,460 --> 00:18:19,130
It's all right, I don't mind.

328
00:18:19,330 --> 00:18:20,420
I'm so sorry.

329
00:18:20,790 --> 00:18:22,880
I've still got some nice curves on me, huh?

330
00:18:23,500 --> 00:18:24,750
Mrs. Kurumatani!

331
00:18:26,750 --> 00:18:29,460
Prairie gentian flowers, right? 
Such a wonderful aroma.

332
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:30,880
Thank you.

333
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:32,210
Oh, it's nothing.

334
00:18:32,210 --> 00:18:33,920
So why aren't you at school right now?

335
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,170
Don't tell me you're skipping class again!

336
00:18:35,170 --> 00:18:37,460
We're out early because it's test week!

337
00:18:37,460 --> 00:18:40,830
Oh wow, and you came all the 
way out here to visit me?

338
00:18:41,790 --> 00:18:44,960
You should have come after 
test week was over, then!

339
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:47,880
Don't make Mrs. Kurumatani feel bad
for interrupting your study time!

340
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:49,170
Please, it's okay.

341
00:18:50,210 --> 00:18:52,420
I had to... come and return this.

342
00:18:54,460 --> 00:18:57,040
Hold on, isn't that the 
bracelet she asked you to...?

343
00:18:57,040 --> 00:18:59,330
You didn't go through with it, then?

344
00:18:59,330 --> 00:19:00,290
I'm sorry.

345
00:19:00,790 --> 00:19:02,080
I'm so relieved!

346
00:19:02,580 --> 00:19:03,420
Huh?

347
00:19:04,040 --> 00:19:07,670
That boy is bright enough 
to recognize who made it.

348
00:19:07,670 --> 00:19:09,710
I think he would have 
figured it out right away.

349
00:19:10,250 --> 00:19:12,040
So I regretted asking you to give it to him.

350
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:13,420
Mrs. Kurumatani...

351
00:19:13,420 --> 00:19:16,420
I'm so glad he didn't end up getting it!

352
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:18,500
Thank you so much, Madoka.

353
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:20,250
Don't mention it.

354
00:19:23,670 --> 00:19:26,960
So, would you mind staying
to chat with me for a little while?

355
00:19:27,290 --> 00:19:29,330
You came right when I 
was feeling a bit bored.

356
00:19:29,790 --> 00:19:31,790
Oh, sure! My pleasure.

357
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:39,500
Recommended Sunset
Tourist Spots

358
00:19:50,290 --> 00:19:52,380
Wow! That was so much fun!

359
00:19:52,380 --> 00:19:54,380
She even gave me this tasty-looking apple.

360
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:57,330
Mrs. Yuka really is so charming.

361
00:19:57,330 --> 00:19:59,670
Oh please, have a little more respect.

362
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:02,330
She was so considerate after 
you barged in like that.

363
00:20:02,330 --> 00:20:04,430
You should have followed through and come up

364
00:20:04,430 --> 00:20:06,770
with some way to give 
Sora that bracelet, jeez.

365
00:20:08,290 --> 00:20:09,380
What a nice aroma...

366
00:20:13,210 --> 00:20:14,580
Hey, Sis?

367
00:20:14,580 --> 00:20:15,420
Hm?

368
00:20:15,420 --> 00:20:17,790
Did Mrs. Yuka... undergo surgery?

369
00:20:18,380 --> 00:20:19,170
What?

370
00:20:20,080 --> 00:20:22,880
I noticed earlier... that 
she had a scar on her chest.

371
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:26,000
Oh, that's from not too long ago.

372
00:20:26,250 --> 00:20:27,920
You have some sharp eyes, Madoka.

373
00:20:28,460 --> 00:20:29,710
Is she all right now?

374
00:20:30,420 --> 00:20:33,580
Well, it certainly wasn't 
a very difficult surgery.

375
00:20:33,750 --> 00:20:35,500
They just cut her open and 
then sewed her back up.

376
00:20:36,630 --> 00:20:37,960
What does that mean?

377
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:40,000
I've never heard of a 
surgery like that before.

378
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:41,960
It's true.

379
00:20:44,710 --> 00:20:46,790
They went in and then stopped.

380
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:54,040
Do you... understand what that means?

381
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:05,630
Whoa, another one?!

382
00:21:06,210 --> 00:21:08,080
You're on fire, Tinytown!

383
00:21:08,080 --> 00:21:10,380
You haven't missed a single shot all day!

384
00:21:10,500 --> 00:21:12,540
I haven't even had a chance 
to touch the ball, dammit!

385
00:21:12,540 --> 00:21:14,130
Well, get used to it!

386
00:21:14,380 --> 00:21:16,330
This shrimp is truly something else.

387
00:21:17,670 --> 00:21:19,950
I'm more impressed by how 
he gets open to shoot,

388
00:21:19,950 --> 00:21:22,260
rather than his accuracy rate.

389
00:21:23,130 --> 00:21:25,270
I can only imagine

390
00:21:23,580 --> 00:21:24,380
One more time!

391
00:21:25,270 --> 00:21:29,250
how many difficult trials he's overcome
with that small frame of his...

392
00:21:30,420 --> 00:21:34,380
My excitement is growing
with every day that we get closer to our first game.

393
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:40,130
We've assembled... some serious firepower!

394
00:21:56,960 --> 00:22:01,880
Hitori ja umaku ikanaku temo

395
00:22:02,420 --> 00:22:06,080
Kikkake nante tanjun sa

396
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:13,040
Mienai deguchi ni hikaru ga sashite

397
00:22:13,500 --> 00:22:17,210
Asu wa soko ni arunda

398
00:22:17,830 --> 00:22:23,880
Hitori nanka ja nakatta

399
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:29,080
Kono me ni utsuru keshiki no naka ni

400
00:22:29,080 --> 00:22:35,460
Kimi ga ireba doko made datte ikeru sa

401
00:22:35,460 --> 00:22:40,330
Kitto genkai nante nainda

402
00:22:40,330 --> 00:22:45,500
Kimi to ireba tsuyoku narunda

403
00:22:45,710 --> 00:22:52,580
Nando demo tachiagatte susunde ikou

404
00:22:52,710 --> 00:23:00,580
Oh oh oh, oh oh oh, oh oh oh,

405
00:23:00,580 --> 00:23:03,540
Saigo no ichibyou made

406
00:23:03,750 --> 00:23:06,380
Akiramenaide busukatte

407
00:23:06,380 --> 00:23:13,460
Kono michi no saki wa 
kanarazu kagayaiteru kara

408
00:23:17,750 --> 00:23:21,380
I went and bruised it... right 
after she gave it to me.

409
00:23:22,630 --> 00:23:25,920
I need to focus. I have tests tomorrow.

410
00:23:28,330 --> 00:23:29,710
I feel sick...

411
00:23:31,040 --> 00:23:35,420
Ahiru no Sora
Next Time: Undiscovered Talent

412
00:23:31,790 --> 00:23:34,290
